# Module 6 Completed: Performance Optimization and Benchmarking

Module 6 implementation is complete! Here is a summary of the benchmarking results, optimizations performed, and file changes.

## 1. Files Changed & Added

- **`backend/pipeline_server.py`**:
  - Upgraded `PipelineMetrics` to record min, max, avg, median statistics for ASR execution time, Real-Time Factor (RTF), and End-to-End latency.
  - Integrated `psutil` system CPU (%) and RSS memory (MB) monitoring.
  - Added structured `[PERF]` logging format emitted for every transcript sent.
  - Attached full pipeline stage timestamps (`audio_capture_time`, `audio_queue_time`, `vad_start_time`, `vad_end_time`, `asr_start_time`, `asr_end_time`, `transcript_generated_time`, `transcript_sent_time`) to transcript event dictionaries.
  - Added Hybrid Energy VAD fallback (`rms > 0.012`) to prevent Silero model/accent false-negatives.

- **`backend/asr/asr_engine.py`**:
  - Added `initial_prompt="English transcript."` and `no_speech_threshold=0.6` to `FasterWhisperEngine` to prevent foreign character hallucinations (`"對,對,對"`) and eliminate hallucination loops on background audio.

- **`live-subtitle-extension/content/overlay.js`**:
  - Added `overlay_received_time`, `overlay_rendered_time`, and DOM render latency calculation.
  - Added `[PERF] Audio -> Overlay` console logging.

- **`backend/benchmark_pipeline.py` [NEW]**:
  - Dedicated automated benchmark suite for streaming audio against `pipeline_server.py`, measuring latency, ASR speed, RTF, RAM, CPU, queue backlog over long runs, and computing WER (Word Error Rate).

- **`benchmark_report.md` [NEW]**:
  - Complete Module 6 Benchmark & Performance Report documenting hardware baseline, bottleneck breakdown, test matrix comparison, and long-run queue stability assessment.

